step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a simple mean across all models to gauge baseline performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the full pool to see if inverse-error weighting improves over the simple mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the full pool to see if it outperforms the weighted mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the full pool to see if removing extremes improves over median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a single best model to see if it outperforms combinations.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ONLY_CWT_rf"}

Thought: Test a dba combination on the full pool to see if it can beat the best single model.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if inverse-error weighting can beat the current best single model.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a different single model that performed well in the pool (DWT_rf) to see if it beats ONLY_CWT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"DWT_rf"}

Thought: Test a simple mean on the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if reducing model diversity improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the slightly larger pool2 to see if expanding the pool improves over weighted pool1 while still using inverse_error weighting.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse_error combination on the larger pool3 to see if expanding the pool improves over the best single model.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the slightly larger pool2 to see if it improves over weighted or mean approaches.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

